--- .gitignore (原始)
```
# Compiled Python files
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# Log files
*.log
bot.log
server.log
```

+++ .gitignore (修改后)
# Examples 1:
(empty)

# Example 2 (Project with artifacts):
# Compiled and build artifacts
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.o
*.obj
dist/
build/
# Dependencies
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*
# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/